sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as 编辑者
    participant UI as 工具/快捷键/Slash
    participant CMD as CommandBus
    participant SES as Session
    participant STR as StructureIndex
    participant HOST as HostAdapter
    participant V as PreviewManager
    User->>UI: 选择加粗(选区)
    UI->>CMD: execute(commandId, selection, documentVersion)
    CMD->>SES: validate context/version/permission
    alt 输入法组合中或版本冲突
        SES-->>CMD: 拒绝+原因
        CMD-->>UI: 安全提示
    else 允许
        CMD->>STR: compute minimal patches
        STR-->>CMD: rangeEdit[]
        CMD->>HOST: applyEditTransaction(expectedVersion, edits)
        HOST-->>CMD: newVersion+undoId
        CMD->>SES: invalidate affected ranges
        SES-->>V: schedule preview update (only if open)
        CMD-->>UI: success
    end
